    "body": "\\(\\sin^2\\theta+\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta=\\dfrac{\\sin^2\\theta+\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta}{\\sin^2\\theta+\\cos^2\\theta}=\\dfrac{\\tan^2\\theta+\\tan\\theta}{\\tan^2\\theta+1}=\\dfrac{4-2}{5}=\\dfrac{2}{5}\\)，选 C。"
   }
